  Slug: magnum-opus
  DisplayName: Magnum Opus
  IconPath: icons/tools/instruments/harp-yellow-teal.webp
  Description: You have tuned your spellcasting to the highest caliber. Add two common
    10th-rank occult spells to your repertoire. You gain a single 10th-rank spell
    slot you can use to cast these spells using bard spellcasting. Unlike other spell
    slots, you can't use 10th-rank slots with abilities that give you more spell
    slots or that let you cast spells without expending spell slots. You don't gain
    more 10th-rank spells as you level up, but you can take the Perfect Encore feat
    to gain a second slot.
